    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1545">

                <pb facs="1156" n="1040" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1040"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/607.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Silliman</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department informed Mazatlan authorities have decreed expropriation Water Supply
                    Company, Mazatlan. At request Spanish Embassy, please confer with Spanish
                    Confidential Agent and exercise best efforts have this property protected
                    against unwarranted molestation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
